      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そうだぞ、シャルロット。\r\n特にレインの幼少期なんて\r\n一つや二つの隠し事ではすまないぞ。",
        "official_en": "Right. Or, in the case of Rain’s younger years, more like one or two thousand.",
        "real_en": "Exactly, Charlotte. And Rain alone has far more than just a secret or two from his childhood."
      },
      "review": {
