        "official_en_sha256": "47bd00fbdb544752fa532a3b15e62104844cad112c32754fe7e16b51e9a7a514"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そしてこれからも、戦うさ。\r\n母上が私を助けてくれたように。\r\n私と同じ「弱き者」を守護するために。",
        "official_en": "And I will keep fighting. Just as Mother saved me once, I will protect those who are as weak as I am.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
