        "official_en_sha256": "5a4da72be264f52ff11873db4740c6595ff4d5eb8e203e99404b8ff7f7025528"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だが、母上に騎士道精神を叩き込まれた者たちだ。\r\n国を思う気持ちも強い。\r\nいずれ復帰してくるはずだ。",
        "official_en": "But Mother hammered the ways of chivalry into them. They care for their country, and I am sure they will come back in due time.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
